<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hi, i've found some Bugs in 2.42 pre22Win<br><br>1. RaySensor is pulsing always if triggert, even the Positive Pulse Mode is off. In that Case it should pulse only on Time if triggert.<br><br>2. There is nomore negative Pulse from the Message Sensor. If triggert by incoming Message it should pulse one positive, and one negative, not? But here are <span style="text-decoration:underline">two</span> Positives.<br><br>I've uploadet some example Files: <a href="http://rapidshare.de/files/21014988/2.42_pre22_Bugs.zip.html" class="postlink">to rapidshere</a><br><br>3.? I've also noticed a Problem with the Motion-blending of Actions. Im still trying to extract and confirm this Bug. Is this the right Place to post it, or better on Blender BugTracker?<br><br>Cu, Doc</div></blockquote>Thanks a lot Doc!<br><br>Non-bullet physics related bug discussion / report is best done on Blender BugTracker. Charlie and me try to reserve some time to fix issues.<br>Actually, the logic system is quite broken at the moment, some rewrite/new UI is necessary. I will try to look at it.<br><br>Thanks,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Sun May 21, 2006 10:25 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
